re in practice, and how his weak numeric memory impacts flight\u2011deck tasks.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that B\u2019s remarks lead to crew conflict or that his numeric memory deficit has caused operational errors; or strong positive evidence that another candidate (e.g., D\u2019s temper is well\u2011controlled, C\u2019s communication improves, or A becomes open to teamwork) outweighs their current drawbacks.\n**Confidence:** moderate (\u2248\u202f65\u202f%).\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
